sequenceDiagram
    actor TPP as PER-006 (PISP)
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    participant Channel as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant IAM as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant DomPay as SVC-009<br/>Domestic Payments
    participant Fraud as SVC-013<br/>Fraud Detection
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant Notifications as SVC-053<br/>Notifications
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over TPP,Audit: PH-115 — VRP Consent Request

    TPP->>Channel: POST /consents {payee, max_single: £500, max_monthly: £500, category: subscription, valid_to: 2027-04-15}
    Channel->>IAM: POST /token/validate {tpp_access_token, scope: vrp:consent}
    IAM-->>Channel: {valid: true, tpp_client_id}
    Channel->>DomPay: Create VrpConsent {params}
    Note right of DomPay: Create VrpConsent (status=pending_authorisation)
    DomPay-->>Channel: consent_id, redirect_uri
    Channel-->>TPP: 201 Created {consent_id, redirect_uri}

    Note over TPP,Audit: PH-116 — Customer Authentication and Consent Authorisation

    TPP->>Customer: Redirect to bank VRP consent portal
    Customer->>Channel: Complete SCA (biometric)
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion}
    IAM-->>Channel: {valid: true}
    Channel-->>Customer: Display consent parameters: max £500/payment, £500/month, subscription, expires 2027-04-15
    Customer->>Channel: Confirm consent grant
    Channel->>DomPay: Activate VrpConsent {consent_id, sca_assertion_ref}
    Note right of DomPay: Update VrpConsent status=active
    DomPay->>EventBus: Publish VrpConsentGranted (EVT-156)
    EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-156 → Send consent confirmation to customer
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-156 → Write immutable consent grant record
    DomPay-->>Channel: consent active; authorisation_code
    Channel-->>TPP: Redirect to redirect_uri with authorisation_code

    Note over TPP,Audit: PH-117 — VRP Payment Execution

    TPP->>Channel: POST /consents/{consent_id}/payments {amount: 49.99, end_to_end_id}
    Channel->>IAM: POST /token/validate {tpp_access_token, scope: vrp:payment}
    IAM-->>Channel: {valid: true}
    Channel->>DomPay: Process VRP payment {consent_id, amount: 49.99}
    Note right of DomPay: Validate: £49.99 ≤ max_single £500 ✓<br/>monthly_aggregate £49.99 ≤ £500 ✓<br/>consent active ✓
    DomPay->>Fraud: Score VRP payment (inline)
    Fraud-->>DomPay: fraud_score: 0.12 (below threshold)
    Note right of DomPay: Execute FPS; create VrpPayment status=executed<br/>increment current_month_aggregate to £49.99
    DomPay->>EventBus: Publish VrpPaymentExecuted (EVT-157)
    EventBus->>Retail: Consume EVT-157 → Debit source account; record transaction
    EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-157 → Send payment confirmation to customer
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-157 → Write payment audit record
    DomPay-->>Channel: vrp_payment_id, fps_end_to_end_id, status: executed
    Channel-->>TPP: 201 Created {vrp_payment_id, fps_end_to_end_id, executed_at}
